# Globe UI

Read `docs/DESIGN.md` before editing UI.

- Tooltips, search, panels, and controls are HTML/React — not 3D canvas text.
- The canvas must not be the only source of country information.
- Do not rely on hover as the only discovery path.
- Keyboard users must search and select countries; focus states must be visible.
- Use semantic HTML and labels for icon-only controls.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for panel and fly-to transitions.
- Mobile: bottom sheet for country details; adequate touch targets; safe-area insets.
- Desktop: panel must not unnecessarily obscure the globe.
- No horizontal overflow at representative mobile/tablet/desktop widths.

Structure: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` (UI overlay layering).
